## Store tests (pure Pinia)

```typescript
import { createPinia, setActivePinia } from 'pinia';
beforeEach(() => setActivePinia(createPinia()));

it('toggles sidenav', () => {
  const store = useUiStore();
  store.toggleSidenav();
  expect(store.isSidenavOpen).toBe(true);
});
```

